          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store the token as the repository secret 'ALARMIFY_TOKEN'. 'gh secret set' prompts for the value, so the token stays out of your shell history." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "トークンをリポジトリの secret「ALARMIFY_TOKEN」に登録します。「gh secret set」はプロンプトでトークンを貼り付けるため、シェルの履歴に残りません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscription" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "課金"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms of Use" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "利用規約"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test alarm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テストアラーム"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 'Get Contents of URL' action, for Shortcuts automations" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「URL の内容を取得」アクションで鳴らす"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free plan includes one token and up to 20 alarms a month" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無料プランではトークン 1 つ・月 20 回までアラームを登録できます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The purchase couldn't be completed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "購入を完了できませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The purchase finished, but Pro couldn't be confirmed. Please try restoring purchases later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "購入は完了しましたが、Pro の反映を確認できませんでした。時間をおいて購入の復元をお試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This value is shown only once. Save it into your service before closing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この値を見られるのは今だけです。外部サービスに設定してから閉じてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To ring only when a command fails, keep its exit status in a variable and exit with it after sending the alarm, so CI still sees the failure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失敗時だけ鳴らす時は終了ステータスを変数に取り、アラーム送信後にその値で exit します (CI が失敗を検知できるように)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "発行済みのトークン"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Disable resolved message so a resolved alert does not ring again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解決時にも鳴らないよう、Disable resolved message をオンにします"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Optional Webhook settings, enable Custom Payload and paste the template." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional Webhook settings で Custom Payload を有効にし、テンプレートを貼り付けます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock a token per service, unlimited alarm scheduling, alarm history, and delivery to multiple devices" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サービスごとのトークン、無制限のアラーム登録、アラーム履歴、複数端末への配送を解放します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upgrade to Pro" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pro にアップグレード"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Test on the contact point; your iPhone should ring within a minute." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知先の Test で、1 分以内に iPhone が鳴ることを確認します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a stubbed API client" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通信をスタブに差し替える"
          }
        }
      }
    },
